WEBVTT

00:02:29.623 --> 00:02:32.922
or fleeing the violence
and pillage of war.

00:02:33.873 --> 00:02:39.220
So I engaged in a series
of diplomatic activities

00:02:39.244 --> 00:02:41.382
right across the subregion

00:02:41.406 --> 00:02:48.019
and convinced the reclusive rebel leader
to initiate peace talks

00:02:48.043 --> 00:02:49.513
for the very first time.

00:02:50.351 --> 00:02:53.476
I also called a national
consultative conference

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.098
of civil society organizations
and stakeholders

00:02:57.122 --> 00:02:59.744
to advise on the best way forward.